Subject: [PATCH] Guard unsupported write preconditions in Odoo CLI mode

Odoo has no comment replay store or skill revision checks yet. Preserve
the existing write routes without promising that these prerequisites hold.
--- a/server/cmd/multica/cmd_issue.go
